# Judging Notes - [SoilSat]

## 1. Impact
Soil degradation is slow, invisible, and devastating. Soil Memory makes it visible by turning raw NASA satellite data 
into clear soil health histories, letting farmers test crop rotations on screen before putting a single seed in the ground.

## 2. Creativity
Existing tools give a real-time snapshot, while Soil Memory gives foresight. We reconstruct a 10-year soil memory profile 
to let farmers simulate how different crop rotations would perform against actual historical climate stress before planting.

